  "title": "Portuguese Snow Drops",
  "description": "Portuguese snow drops, or &#39;sonjos,&#39; are small meringue cookies made of beaten egg whites, sugar, and lemon juice. Add food coloring or sprinkles for seasonal decoration.",
  "authors": [
    "John Pacheco"
  ],
